# oracle-inputs: single_layer_MoS2.data
# oracle-potentials: MoS.rebomos
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# oracle: pair rebomos (MoS2 REBO + LJ) on examples/threebody/single_layer_MoS2.data as in in.mos2.rebomos, cut down to 20 steps; velocity loop all (see the report: loop geom hashes the triclinic coordinates)
units           metal
boundary        p p f
atom_style      atomic
read_data       single_layer_MoS2.data
mass            * 32.065
mass            1 95.94
pair_style      rebomos
pair_coeff      * * MoS.rebomos Mo S S
timestep        0.001
velocity        all create 300.0 12345 loop all
thermo_style    custom step etotal pe ke temp
thermo_modify   format float %.15g lost warn
thermo          5
fix             1 all nve
run             20
